	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0203_poke4_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンは　いわかべを　かけあがり
ほらあなの　どこかへ　きえてしまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:25:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンは　岩壁を　駆け上がり
洞穴の　どこかへ　消えてしまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:25:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・ポケモンを倒した場合</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:25:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POKE4
ポケモン・コバルオン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:25:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0203_oldman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんじゅうねんも　さがしもとめた
でんせつの　ポケモン　コバルオン……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:48:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:41:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>何十年も　探し求めた
伝説の　ポケモン　コバルオン……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:48:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:41:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・コバルオンが
　いる
　いない</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:44:08" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:40:55" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0203_oldman_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひとと　ポケモンだけでは　ない…
いきものは　おたがいに　みとめあい▼
しんらいしあって　いきていくことが
いちばん　なんじゃ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:45:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:45:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人と　ポケモンだけでは　ない…
生きるものは　お互いに　認めあい▼
信頼しあって　生きていくことが
一番なんじゃ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:45:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:45:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:45:51" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:47:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
</MessageStudioText>